  "id": "team-building",
  "term": "team building",
  "definition": "Team building is the use of planned group strategies or activities to strengthen how a team functions and works together. In this source, it refers to an intervention aimed at improving group dynamics such as role clarity, team identification, communication, cohesion, commitment, collective efficacy, and perceived performance.",
